This is also the tangent to parabola $x^2=-8 y\begin{aligned}
& \therefore \quad x^2=-8\left(m x+\frac{1}{m}\right) \\
& \Rightarrow m x^2+8 m^2 x+8=0
\end{aligned}$<br/>It has equal roots, if
$\begin{aligned}
